(F4 T6d C11, Professional test/other dynamic3: prescribed acceleration at
 node 1, the truss is dragged and inverts (node 1 passes node 2). With
 materi_displacement the default group_truss_memory is -total_linear
 (manual 4.12: total Lagrange); the length projected on the initial axis
 keeps its sign. Target node 2 disx = Professional 02-08-2026
 (6.044025070687e+01). Old GNU (default -updated): 32.6583.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 1
materi_displacement
materi_velocity
materi_acceleration
